<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,467.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,467.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,467 today from 1,465 on Feb 17, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1568    14.236	  1568    14.231</p>
<p>   1a   1498 11343.000	  1499 11350.000</p>
<p>   2    1859    26.564	  1861    26.588</p>
<p>   2a   1867 15314.000	  1874 15369.000</p>
<p>   3    1620    14.943	  1599    14.750</p>
<p>   3a   1512 11936.000	  1510 11919.000</p>
